          "worked": "$C(-4,-4)$ and $B(3,2)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{CB}&=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\\\m_{CB}&=\\frac{2-(-4)}{3-(-4)}\\\\m_{CB}&=\\frac{6}{7}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q1-c",
